<title>GERMANY: RESEARCH ALERT-Vereinsbank donwgrades Degussa.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Vereinsbank donwgrades Degussa.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Vereinsbank said on Thursday it had downgraded shares in chemical concern Degussa from outperform to neutral following recent sharp increases in the price of its stock.</p>
</text>
